<Project>

    <!--
        Build firewall — DO NOT add <Import> of the repository-root Directory.Build.props.

        This file exists to STOP MSBuild's upward Directory.Build.props discovery at this folder, so this
        quarantined tree does not inherit the engine's build context from the repository root. The
        architecture gate is hooked at the root: without this firewall it would run on a project deliberately
        removed from Puck.slnx and fail it against a ledger that cannot describe it. QUARANTINE MEANS
        UNGATED, and this pair is what makes that structural rather than a path filter someone maintains.

        No csproj lives here. ISwitchViWindowBackend.cs and ViNativeWindow.cs are the open-source half of the
        Nintendo Switch (VI) windowing contract — read as prior art, never built here. The licensed backend
        that implements ISwitchViWindowBackend ships outside this repository.
    -->

</Project>
